  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "A circle's area is \\(\\pi\\) times the radius multiplied by itself. Using \\(3.14\\) for \\(\\pi\\),\n\\[\n3.14\\times(2\\times2)=3.14\\times4=12.56.\n\\]\nThe area is approximately \\(12.56\\text{ cm}^2\\).",
